# What to leave out of the npm tarball (the MCP server distribution).
#
# This file exists because vsce refuses to run with both a "files" property in
# package.json and a .vscodeignore. npm gets .npmignore, vsce gets
# .vscodeignore, and neither strategy interferes with the other.
#
# Note that .npmignore fully replaces .gitignore for packaging purposes, so
# dist/ is included here even though git ignores it — that is the shipped build.

src/
out/
esbuild.mjs
tsconfig.json
examples/
bench/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
.mcp.json
.vscodeignore
.gitattributes
**/*.map
*.vsix
